VISIBLE "## Source-ka dhisa"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Kayd akkuk mal build entry le. Atu kaa tool-yo install aba kaak kayd root a command-yo aba."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ Make-ih"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "C++11 gita compiler kaa need."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Build maxxaxa qaaxa::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make clean"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Default akkuk `fozu` kaak `what` aba; Windows a `beep_win` aba."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ CMake-ih"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "CMake 3.16 kaak akkok version, C++ compiler kaa need."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cmake -S . -B build/cmake"
VISIBLE "cmake --build build/cmake"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ Meson-ih"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Meson, Ninja kaak C++ compiler kaa need."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "meson setup build/meson"
VISIBLE "meson compile -C build/meson"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Python kaak Rust maturin-ih"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Python extension Rust kaak [maturin](https:://www.maturin.rs/) ih build. Rust toolchain (`cargo` le) kaak Python 3.13 kaak akkok version kaa need."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "python -m venv .venv"
VISIBLE "source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows:: .venv\Scripts\activate"
VISIBLE "python -m pip install maturin"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Virtual environment a maqcaw command-yo aba::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "# Compile aba kaak virtual env a seeg"
VISIBLE "maturin develop"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "# Distributable wheel maxxaxa build aba"
VISIBLE "maturin build --release"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Wheel build maxxaxa `target/wheels/` a. Rust extension entry code [`src/lib.rs`](src/lib.rs) a, Python build config [`pyproject.toml`](pyproject.toml) a."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### TypeScript Hereby-ih"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "TypeScript part `typescript/` a, Node.js, npm kaak Hereby aba::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cd typescript"
VISIBLE "npm install"
VISIBLE "npm run build::compiler"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Compiler kaak test target mal build need, `npm run build` aba. Build maxxaxa qaaxa, `npm run clean` aba."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Maqaan gibir"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Build aba, 114GB RAM kaak 514GB storage need, 1919810 core CPU 10GHz a aba need."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Linux qeebiba kayd"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Distribution package template `debian/` kaak `packaging/` a. A kayd-yo C++ command program `fozu` kaak `what` install aba; Python/Rust extension maturin flow aba. Kayd akkuk unified open-source license ame uma, release-ak hornsif license field-yo yaamene kaak replace aba."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Debian kaak Ubuntu"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "`dpkg-buildpackage`, Debhelper, CMake kaak GCC kaa need."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt update"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install build-essential cmake debhelper devscripts"
VISIBLE "dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ../break-this-repo_0.0.0_$(dpkg --print-architecture).deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Build abe `.deb` maxxaxa direct install aba::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ./break-this-repo_*.deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Arch Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "`base-devel`, CMake kaak GCC kaa need. Source-ka `PKGBUILD` version gita archive maxxaxa aba::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo pacman -S --needed base-devel cmake gcc"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o packaging/archlinux/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "cd packaging/archlinux"
VISIBLE "makepkg -si"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Fedora"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "RPM build tool, CMake kaak GCC kaa need."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install @development-tools cmake rpmdevtools"
VISIBLE "rpmdev-setuptree"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o ~/rpmbuild/SOURCES/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "rpmbuild -ba packaging/fedora/break-this-repo.spec"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install ~/rpmbuild/RPMS/$(uname -m)/break-this-repo-0.0.0-1.*.rpm"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Gentoo"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "ebuild local overlay a copy aba, kaak Portage Manifest aba kaak install::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo mkdir -p /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo cp packaging/gentoo/app-misc/break-this-repo/* \"
VISIBLE "	/var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo/"
VISIBLE "cd /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo ebuild break-this-repo-0.0.0.ebuild manifest"
VISIBLE "sudo emerge --ask app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "```"
