VISIBLE "## Source-š fra-build"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "ima repository vasati many independent build-entry. yūš fra-yazəδa ima upayō anušaya āt ima repository root-š command-š frā-yāršta."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ āt Make"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "C++11 support-š compiler-š kāma::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "clean build artifact::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make clean"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "default-š fra-kaṇta `fozu` āt `what`; Windows-š api fra-kaṇta `beep_win`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ āt CMake"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "CMake 3.16 or up-š version-š āt C++ compiler-š kāma::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cmake -S . -B build/cmake"
VISIBLE "cmake --build build/cmake"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ āt Meson"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Meson, Ninja āt C++ compiler-š kāma::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "meson setup build/meson"
VISIBLE "meson compile -C build/meson"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Python āt Rust āt maturin"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Python extension-š Rust āt [maturin](https:://www.maturin.rs/) fra-kaṇta. Rust toolchain (`cargo` āt) āt Python 3.13 or up-š kāma::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "python -m venv .venv"
VISIBLE "source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows:: .venv\Scripts\activate"
VISIBLE "python -m pip install maturin"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "virtual environment-š asti command-š frā-yāršta::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "# fra-kaṇta āt install-aya imąm virtual environment-š"
VISIBLE "maturin develop"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "# fra-kaṇta distributable wheel file-š"
VISIBLE "maturin build --release"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "wheel build artifact-š `target/wheels/`-š asti. Rust extension-š entry code-š [`src/lib.rs`](src/lib.rs), Python build config-š [`pyproject.toml`](pyproject.toml)."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### TypeScript āt Hereby"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "TypeScript bhāga-š `typescript/`-š asti, Node.js, npm āt Hereby fra-yāršta::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cd typescript"
VISIBLE "npm install"
VISIBLE "npm run build::compiler"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "compiler āt test target saθa build-š kāma, `npm run build` frā-yāršta. clean build artifact-š `npm run clean` frā-yāršta."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## important-addendum"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "compile-time-š kamu at least 114GB memory āt 514GB up-š storage, 1919810-core CPU 10GHz-š frā-yāršta"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Linux distribution package-š"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "distribution packaging template-š `debian/` āt `packaging/`-š asti. ima package-š install-ayeiti C++ command-line program `fozu` āt `what`; Python/Rust extension-š upari maturin flow fra-yāršta. repository-š aθravaēnaθa unified open-source license declare-š nōit asti, release pərəsa ima packaging file-š license field confirm āt replace fra-yazəδa."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Debian āt Ubuntu"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "`dpkg-buildpackage`, Debhelper, CMake āt GCC kāma::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt update"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install build-essential cmake debhelper devscripts"
VISIBLE "dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ../break-this-repo_0.0.0_$(dpkg --print-architecture).deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "api directly install build-š `.deb` file-š::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ./break-this-repo_*.deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Arch Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "`base-devel`, CMake āt GCC kāma. prāma source-š `PKGBUILD` version-š match-š archive file fra-kaṇta::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo pacman -S --needed base-devel cmake gcc"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o packaging/archlinux/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "cd packaging/archlinux"
VISIBLE "makepkg -si"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Fedora"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "RPM build tool, CMake āt GCC kāma::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install @development-tools cmake rpmdevtools"
VISIBLE "rpmdev-setuptree"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o ~/rpmbuild/SOURCES/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "rpmbuild -ba packaging/fedora/break-this-repo.spec"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install ~/rpmbuild/RPMS/$(uname -m)/break-this-repo-0.0.0-1.*.rpm"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Gentoo"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "ebuild-š local overlay-š copy āt Portage-š Manifest fra-kaṇta āt install::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo mkdir -p /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo cp packaging/gentoo/app-misc/break-this-repo/* \"
VISIBLE "	/var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo/"
VISIBLE "cd /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo ebuild break-this-repo-0.0.0.ebuild manifest"
VISIBLE "sudo emerge --ask app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "```"
