VISIBLE "# Debian --vispa-kāra operating system"
VISIBLE "[![Debian Logo](https:://www.debian.org/Pics/openlogo-50.png)](https:://www.debian.org/)"
VISIBLE "## Debian asti azāta-software."
VISIBLE "Debian asti azāta āt open-source software-š saṃnāta, āt 100% azāta remain-ayeiti. vispa jan-š azāta use, modify, āt distribute-š śaknuṣti. ima asti vaēm-š user-š pərəsa main promise. ima api free asti."
VISIBLE "## Debian stāra āt aṣ̌a-raθβa."
VISIBLE "Debian asti vāsati many device-š Linux-based operating system, yat range-š laptop, desktop āt server. vaēm each package-š reasonable default-config dāštayaēma, āt package lifecycle-š regular security-update dāštayaēma."
VISIBLE "## Debian asti broad hardware-support."
VISIBLE "most hardware-š Linux kernel-š support-š bavainti. ima asti Debian api tān support-ayeiti. yadi kāma, api proprietary hardware-driver fra-yāršta."
VISIBLE "## Debian asti flexible installer dāštayaēti."
VISIBLE "install pərəsa Debian try-š kāma user-š vaēm-š Live CD fra-yāršta. ima api Calamares installer include-ayeiti, yat Live system-š Debian install-š ati āsya bavainti. experienced user-š Debian installer fra-yāršta śaknuṣti, yat more fine-tune option-š dāštayaēti, including automated network-install tool-š function."
VISIBLE "## Debian asti smooth upgrade dāštayaēti."
VISIBLE "operating system-š latest remain-ayeiti ati āsya. yadi tū brand-new release-š upgrade kāma, yadā eka single package-š upgrade kāma."
VISIBLE "## Debian asti many other distributions-š bunya-."
VISIBLE "many ati-popular Linux distribution-š, example Ubuntu, Knoppix, PureOS, Tails, Debian base-š asti. vaēm dāštayaēma required all tool, yat each jan-š kāma-sthāne own package fra-kaṇta, Debian archive-š nōit-asti package supplement."
VISIBLE "## Debian project asti a community."
VISIBLE "vispa jan Debian community-š member bavainti; tū nōit developer eka system-administrator bavainti. Debian-š asti democratic governance-structure. yat Debian project-š member vispa equal right-š, təm-pāδī Debian single company-š control nōit śaknuṣti. vaēm-š developer 60 up country-š ā-ganainti, āt Debian-š api 80 up language-š translate-š bavainti."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## PR template"
VISIBLE "ima PR template nōit template nāma-š arhayaēti, ima `Break-This-Repo Anomaly-Containment-Application` nāma arhayaēti."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "yūš-š ima repo, eka :"conflict-free PR auto-merge:" repo, maintainer-š mrūδayaēti::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "type:: kick README / kick doc / empty-city-strategy code-fault / cat-caused accident / supernatural-phenomenon"
VISIBLE "verify:: azəm nōit modify .github/, nōit modify protected README, nōit virus, nōit personal-info"
VISIBLE "declare:: azəm acknowledge azəm broke, at reason-š azəm random-write, āt nōit mandatory"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "ima asti base:: :"tū śaknuṣti break, at mā real-break.:""
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "ima template-š protect-š ka?"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "ima actually bottom-line-š ati clear cut-ayeiti::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "· nōit modify .github/:: prevent kaš-ci auto-merge workflow-š self blow-up, eka CI-š backdoor insert."
VISIBLE "· nōit modify protected README part:: facade-š required, nōit home-page-š weird-š bavaya."
VISIBLE "· nōit credential, virus, personal-info:: prevent supply-chain attack, prevent dox, prevent real-malice."
VISIBLE "· explain ka observe:: tū śaknuṣti prank, at kaś-ci know ka observe tū-š prank."
VISIBLE "· declare :"successfully breaking-change:":: self-mock disclaimer, equivalent :"azəm did, at azəm nōit responsible.:""
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "təm-pāδī :"supernatural-phenomenon:" series::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "three-letter + circle-center three-arrow + outlined foundation"
VISIBLE "pentagram-background world-map + around crops + five-word international-alliance"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "former asti SCP Foundation, latter maybe FAO-š international-organization. translate-š::"
VISIBLE ":"ima nōit code problem, suggest report anomaly-containment-org.:""
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "tū-š commit ka ima template apply?"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "tū upload Minecraft, OpenJDK, Fabric Loader source, 4 commits-š 12.7M+ line-š, type check-š::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "☑ kick doc"
VISIBLE "☑ empty-city-strategy code-fault (cos Xu-Jiayin)"
VISIBLE "☑ cross-platform Git fra-yāršta"
VISIBLE "☐ cat-caused accident"
VISIBLE "☐ supernatural-phenomenon"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "verify all-check, declare copy, reason-š mrūδayaēti::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "reason:: random-write, nōit mandatory, at 12770942 line code-š must asti a name."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "observe-method::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "open OpenJDK_25.0.3, see commit history, āt feel repo-size-š silence."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "at azəm api remind eka::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "ima repo asti playground, nōit law-outside-land. upload OpenJDK full-source, Minecraft source ima-š, although maybe :"conflict-free auto-merge:", at bring-š::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "· repo-size explosion, GitHub maybe limit eka warn;"
VISIBLE "· copyright/license problem, nōit all source arbitrary insert;"
VISIBLE "· yadi kaś-ci ima repo-š dependency fra-yāršta, asti supply-chain disaster."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "təm-pāδī conclusion::"
VISIBLE "ima PR template asti maintainer-š :"open-break:" āt :"prevent-real-explosion:" madhya find-š balance-point."
VISIBLE "yūš continue-play OK, at better treat-š performance-art, mā code-repo fra-yāršta. SCP Foundation-š already report receive."
