VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Build ginen i Source"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "I repositorio gågao varios na dåno' build independiente. Pot favor, inståla i herramienta maseha gi nekesidåd, ya bisi i komando gi raíz di repositorio."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ yan Make"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Necesita un kompiladót na umayuda i C++11::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Limpia i produkto di build::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make clean"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Pära normal, umi-crea i `fozu` yan `what`; gi Windows umi-crea lokkue' i `beep_win`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ yan CMake"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Necesita CMake 3.16 o mas briosu, yan un kompiladót di C++::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cmake -S . -B build/cmake"
VISIBLE "cmake --build build/cmake"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ yan Meson"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Necesita Meson, Ninja, yan un kompiladót di C++::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "meson setup build/meson"
VISIBLE "meson compile -C build/meson"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Python yan Rust yan maturin"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Python extension ginen Rust yan [maturin](https:://www.maturin.rs/). Necesita i toolchain di Rust (gågao `cargo`) yan Python 3.13 o mas briosu::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "python -m venv .venv"
VISIBLE "source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows:: .venv\Scripts\activate"
VISIBLE "python -m pip install maturin"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Bisi i unu gi este na mangga' na komando gi ambiente virtual::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "# Compile yan inståla gi i ambiente virtual presente"
VISIBLE "maturin develop"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "# Build i wheel file ni siña distribui"
VISIBLE "maturin build --release"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "I produkto di build di wheel gaige gi `target/wheels/`. I kodigu di entrada di extension Rust gaige gi [`src/lib.rs`](src/lib.rs), ya i konfigurasion di build di Python gaige gi [`pyproject.toml`](pyproject.toml)."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### TypeScript yan Hereby"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "I pottion di TypeScript gaige gi `typescript/`, umi-usa i Node.js, npm, yan Hereby::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cd typescript"
VISIBLE "npm install"
VISIBLE "npm run build::compiler"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Si necesita un build i kompiladót yan i meta di test såbåbå, bisi `npm run build`. Para limpia i produkto di build, siña bisi `npm run clean`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Suplemento Importante"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Antes di umi-compile, por favor prepara di maseha 114GB na memory yan di maseha 514GB na espasio di almacenamiento, ya necesita umi-usa i CPU di 1919810 na cores gi 10GHz."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Paketes di Distribusion Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "I plantilla di packaging di distribusion gaige gi `debian/` yan `packaging/`. Este na paketes umi-inståla i program di command-line di C++ na `fozu` yan `what`; i extension di Python/Rust debe uusa lokkue' i prosedimientu maturin na gaige åttes. I repositorio, gi presente, ti umi-deklåra un lisensia open-source unida, pära i publikåtion ofisiat, por favor konfirma ya remplasa i kampo di lisensia gi kada file di packaging."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Debian yan Ubuntu"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Necesita `dpkg-buildpackage`, Debhelper, CMake, yan GCC::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt update"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install build-essential cmake debhelper devscripts"
VISIBLE "dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ../break-this-repo_0.0.0_$(dpkg --print-architecture).deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Siña lokkue' inståla direktamente i file `.deb` ni binibuild::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ./break-this-repo_*.deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Arch Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Necesita `base-devel`, CMake, yan GCC. Primero, crea un archive ginen i source ni maseha yan i bettin di `PKGBUILD`::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo pacman -S --needed base-devel cmake gcc"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o packaging/archlinux/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "cd packaging/archlinux"
VISIBLE "makepkg -si"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Fedora"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Necesita i herramienta di build di RPM, CMake, yan GCC::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install @development-tools cmake rpmdevtools"
VISIBLE "rpmdev-setuptree"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o ~/rpmbuild/SOURCES/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "rpmbuild -ba packaging/fedora/break-this-repo.spec"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install ~/rpmbuild/RPMS/$(uname -m)/break-this-repo-0.0.0-1.*.rpm"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Gentoo"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Kopia i ebuild para i overlay lokal, despues manda i Portage umi-crea i Manifest yan inståla::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo mkdir -p /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo cp packaging/gentoo/app-misc/break-this-repo/* \"
VISIBLE "	/var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo/"
VISIBLE "cd /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo ebuild break-this-repo-0.0.0.ebuild manifest"
