VISIBLE "## On-site infrastructure archaeology archive"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "![EGIEM-R1 prototype, the real thing:: on-site photo](./Emergency-Generator-Interface-Elevation-Module/assets/rock-field-photo.png)"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "This repository now houses a low-power, high-reliability, completely offline piece of on-site infrastructure:: a rock that was temporarily conscripted at a critical moment. It has no CPU, no network card, and no plans to resign; using nothing but its own weight, it holds the interface box steady in just the right position."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "The yellow tag is what upgrades :"picked up a rock:" into :"entered into the equipment registry:". After a preliminary assessment, this device needs no login, no updates and no restarts; the only known maintenance action is:: don't touch it."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Upstream dependency:: carrier generator interface box  "
VISIBLE "Downstream dependency:: Earth  "
VISIBLE "Operating status:: running stably"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "The photo is the original on-site image provided by the contributor; only the file name was normalised — no cropping, no redrawing."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "> **If it works, don't move the rock.**"
