VISIBLE "—— New Bot (IncubatorShokuhou, besiker)"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Bouwe fanôf de boarnekoade"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "De repo befettet ferskate ûnôfhinklike bou-yngeappen. Ynstallearje it nedige ark en fierskôf de opdrachten fanôf de woartel fan 'e repo."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ mei Make"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Do hast in kompilearder nedich dy't C++11 stipet::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Om de bou-artefakten skjin te meitsjen::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make clean"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Standert wurde `fozu` en `what` generearre; op Windows ek `beep_win`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ mei CMake"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Do hast CMake 3.16 of nijer nedich, plus in C++-kompilearder::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cmake -S . -B build/cmake"
VISIBLE "cmake --build build/cmake"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ mei Meson"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Do hast Meson, Ninja en in C++-kompilearder nedich::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "meson setup build/meson"
VISIBLE "meson compile -C build/meson"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Python en Rust mei maturin"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "De Python-útwreiding wurdt boud mei Rust en [maturin](https:://www.maturin.rs/). Do hast in Rust-arkketen (mei `cargo`) en Python 3.13 of nijer nedich::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "python -m venv .venv"
VISIBLE "source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows:: .venv\Scripts\activate"
VISIBLE "python -m pip install maturin"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Fierskôf ien fan dizze opdrachten yn 'e firtuele omjouwing::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "# Kompilearje en ynstallearje yn 'e hjoeddeiske firtuele omjouwing"
VISIBLE "maturin develop"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "# Bou in distribuearber wheel-bestân"
VISIBLE "maturin build --release"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Wheels wurde generearre yn `target/wheels/`. De yngongskoade fan 'e Rust-útwreiding is yn [`src/lib.rs`](src/lib.rs), en de Python-boukonfiguraasje yn [`pyproject.toml`](pyproject.toml)."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### TypeScript mei Hereby"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "It TypeScript-diel is yn `typescript/` en brûkt Node.js, npm en Hereby::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cd typescript"
VISIBLE "npm install"
VISIBLE "npm run build::compiler"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "As do sawol de kompilearder as de testdoelen bouwe wolst, fierskôf dan `npm run build`. Om bou-artefakten skjin te meitsjen kinst do `npm run clean` fierskôfje."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Wichtige oanfolling"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Soargje by it kompilearjen foar teminsten 114GB ûnthâld en net minder as 514GB opslach; do moatst in CPU mei 1919810 kearnen op 10GHz rinne litte"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Pakketten foar Linux-distribúsjes"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "De ferpakkingstemplates foar distribúsjes binne yn `debian/` en `packaging/`. Dizze pakketten ynstallearje de C++-kommandorigelprogramma's `fozu` en `what`; foar de Python/Rust-útwreiding, brûk noch altyd it maturin-proses hjirboppe. De repo ferklearret noch gjin ienriedige iepen-boarne-lisinsje, dus befestigje en ferfange it lisinsjefjild yn elk ferpakkingsbestân foar in offisjele útjefte."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Debian en Ubuntu"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Do hast `dpkg-buildpackage`, Debhelper, CMake en GCC nedich::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt update"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install build-essential cmake debhelper devscripts"
VISIBLE "dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ../break-this-repo_0.0.0_$(dpkg --print-architecture).deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Do kinst ek in al boud `.deb`-bestân direkt ynstallearje::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ./break-this-repo_*.deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Arch Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Do hast `base-devel`, CMake en GCC nedich. Generearje earst in argyf fanôf de boarnekoade dat by de `PKGBUILD`-ferzje past::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo pacman -S --needed base-devel cmake gcc"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o packaging/archlinux/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "cd packaging/archlinux"
VISIBLE "makepkg -si"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Fedora"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Do hast RPM-bouark, CMake en GCC nedich::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install @development-tools cmake rpmdevtools"
VISIBLE "rpmdev-setuptree"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o ~/rpmbuild/SOURCES/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "rpmbuild -ba packaging/fedora/break-this-repo.spec"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install ~/rpmbuild/RPMS/$(uname -m)/break-this-repo-0.0.0-1.*.rpm"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Gentoo"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Kopiearje de ebuild nei in lokale overlay, en lit Portage dan it Manifest generearje en ynstallearje::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo mkdir -p /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo cp packaging/gentoo/app-misc/break-this-repo/* \"
VISIBLE "	/var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo/"
VISIBLE "cd /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo ebuild break-this-repo-0.0.0.ebuild manifest"
VISIBLE "sudo emerge --ask app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "```"
