VISIBLE "## Vum Quellcode bauen"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Den Repository enthält méi onofhängeg Build-Agankspunkten. Installéier déi néideg Tools a fëll d'Kommandos vun der Wuerzel vum Repository aus."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ mat Make"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Du brauchs en Compiler, deen C++11 ënnerstëtzt::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Fir d'Build-Artefakte propper ze maachen::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make clean"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Standard gëtt `fozu` an `what` generéiert; op Windows och `beep_win`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ mat CMake"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Du brauchs CMake 3.16 oder méi nei, plus en C++-Compiler::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cmake -S . -B build/cmake"
VISIBLE "cmake --build build/cmake"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ mat Meson"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Du brauchs Meson, Ninja an en C++-Compiler::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "meson setup build/meson"
VISIBLE "meson compile -C build/meson"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Python a Rust mat maturin"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "D'Python-Erweiderung gëtt mat Rust a [maturin](https:://www.maturin.rs/) gebaut. Du brauchs eng Rust-Toolchain (mat `cargo`) a Python 3.13 oder méi nei::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "python -m venv .venv"
VISIBLE "source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows:: .venv\Scripts\activate"
VISIBLE "python -m pip install maturin"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Féier eng vun dëse Kommandos an der virtueller Ëmfeld aus::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "# Kompiléieren an an den aktuelle virtuelle Ëmfeld installéieren"
VISIBLE "maturin develop"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "# Eng distribuéierbar wheel-Datei bauen"
VISIBLE "maturin build --release"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Wheels ginn an `target/wheels/` generéiert. Den Agankscode vun der Rust-Erweiderung ass an [`src/lib.rs`](src/lib.rs), an d'Python-Build-Konfiguratioun an [`pyproject.toml`](pyproject.toml)."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### TypeScript mat Hereby"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Den TypeScript-Deel ass an `typescript/` a benotzt Node.js, npm an Hereby::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cd typescript"
VISIBLE "npm install"
VISIBLE "npm run build::compiler"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Wann s du souwuel den Compiler wéi och d'Testziler baue wëlls, féier `npm run build` aus. Fir d'Build-Artefakte propper ze maachen, kanns du `npm run clean` ausféieren."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Wichteg Ergänzung"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Suerg beim Kompiléieren fir mindestens 114GB Erënnerung an net manner wéi 514GB Späicherplaz; du muss eng CPU mat 1919810 Kären op 10GHz lafen"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Pakete fir Linux-Distributiounen"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "D'Verpackungsmodeller fir Distributiounen sinn an `debian/` a `packaging/`. Dës Pakete installéieren d'C++-Kommandozeilprogrammer `fozu` an `what`; fir d'Python/Rust-Erweiderung, benotz nach ëmmer de maturin-Floss uewen. Den Repository deklaréiert nach keng eenheetlech Open-Source-Lizenz, dofir kontrolléier a ersetz d'Lizenzfeld an all Verpackungsdatei virun enger offizieller Verëffentlechung."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Debian an Ubuntu"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Du brauchs `dpkg-buildpackage`, Debhelper, CMake a GCC::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt update"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install build-essential cmake debhelper devscripts"
VISIBLE "dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ../break-this-repo_0.0.0_$(dpkg --print-architecture).deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Du kanns och eng scho gebaute `.deb`-Datei direkt installéieren::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ./break-this-repo_*.deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Arch Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Du brauchs `base-devel`, CMake a GCC. Generéier fir d'éischt en Archiv vum Quellcode, deen zur Versioun am `PKGBUILD` passt::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo pacman -S --needed base-devel cmake gcc"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o packaging/archlinux/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "cd packaging/archlinux"
VISIBLE "makepkg -si"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Fedora"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Du brauchs RPM-Buildtools, CMake a GCC::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install @development-tools cmake rpmdevtools"
VISIBLE "rpmdev-setuptree"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o ~/rpmbuild/SOURCES/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "rpmbuild -ba packaging/fedora/break-this-repo.spec"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install ~/rpmbuild/RPMS/$(uname -m)/break-this-repo-0.0.0-1.*.rpm"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Gentoo"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Kopéier den ebuild an en lokalen Overlay, a loosse Portage dann de Manifest generéieren an installéieren::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo mkdir -p /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo cp packaging/gentoo/app-misc/break-this-repo/* \"
VISIBLE "	/var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo/"
VISIBLE "cd /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo ebuild break-this-repo-0.0.0.ebuild manifest"
VISIBLE "sudo emerge --ask app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "```"
