VISIBLE "## Compilar dempuèi lo còde font"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Lo depaus conten mantun ponch d'intrada de compilacion independents. Installatz las aisinas que cal e executatz las comandas dempuèi la raiç del depaus."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ amb Make"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Cal un compilador compatible amb C++11::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Per netejar los artefactes de compilacion::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make clean"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Per defaut genèra `fozu` e `what`; sus Windows tanben `beep_win`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ amb CMake"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Cal CMake 3.16 o mai recent, e un compilador C++::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cmake -S . -B build/cmake"
VISIBLE "cmake --build build/cmake"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ amb Meson"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Calon Meson, Ninja e un compilador C++::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "meson setup build/meson"
VISIBLE "meson compile -C build/meson"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Python e Rust amb maturin"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "L'extension Python es compilada amb Rust e [maturin](https:://www.maturin.rs/). Cal una toolchain Rust (amb `cargo`) e Python 3.13 o mai recent::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "python -m venv .venv"
VISIBLE "source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows:: .venv\Scripts\activate"
VISIBLE "python -m pip install maturin"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Dins l'environament virtual, executatz una d'aquestas comandas::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "# Compilar e installar dins l'environament virtual actual"
VISIBLE "maturin develop"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "# Construire un fichièr wheel distribuïble"
VISIBLE "maturin build --release"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Los wheels se generan dins `target/wheels/`. Lo còde d'intrada de l'extension Rust es dins [`src/lib.rs`](src/lib.rs), e la configuracion de compilacion Python dins [`pyproject.toml`](pyproject.toml)."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### TypeScript amb Hereby"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "La part TypeScript se tròba dins `typescript/` e utiliza Node.js, npm e Hereby::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cd typescript"
VISIBLE "npm install"
VISIBLE "npm run build::compiler"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Se volètz compilar ensems lo compilador e las ciblas de tèst, executatz `npm run build`. Per netejar los artefactes de compilacion podètz executar `npm run clean`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Apondeson importanta"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "En compilant, preparatz almens 114GB de memòria e pas mens de 514GB d'emmagazinatge; cal far servir una CPU de 1919810 nuclèus a 10GHz"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Paquets per a distribucions de Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Los modèls d'empaquetatge per a distribucions son dins `debian/` e `packaging/`. Aquestes paquets installan los programmes de linha de comanda C++ `fozu` e `what`; per l'extension Python/Rust, utilizatz encara lo flux maturin çai sus. Lo depaus declara pas encara una licéncia open source unificada, doncas abans de publicar oficialament, verificatz e remplaçatz lo camp de licéncia dins cada fichièr d'empaquetatge."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Debian e Ubuntu"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Calon `dpkg-buildpackage`, Debhelper, CMake e GCC::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt update"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install build-essential cmake debhelper devscripts"
VISIBLE "dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ../break-this-repo_0.0.0_$(dpkg --print-architecture).deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Podètz tanben installar dirèctament un fichièr `.deb` ja compilat::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ./break-this-repo_*.deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Arch Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Calon `base-devel`, CMake e GCC. Primièr generatz a partir del còde font un archiu que corresponda a la version del `PKGBUILD`::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo pacman -S --needed base-devel cmake gcc"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o packaging/archlinux/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "cd packaging/archlinux"
VISIBLE "makepkg -si"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Fedora"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Calon las aisinas de compilacion RPM, CMake e GCC::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install @development-tools cmake rpmdevtools"
VISIBLE "rpmdev-setuptree"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o ~/rpmbuild/SOURCES/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "rpmbuild -ba packaging/fedora/break-this-repo.spec"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install ~/rpmbuild/RPMS/$(uname -m)/break-this-repo-0.0.0-1.*.rpm"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Gentoo"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Copiatz l'ebuild dins un overlay local, puei daissatz Portage generar lo Manifest e installar::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo mkdir -p /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo cp packaging/gentoo/app-misc/break-this-repo/* \"
VISIBLE "	/var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo/"
VISIBLE "cd /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo ebuild break-this-repo-0.0.0.ebuild manifest"
VISIBLE "sudo emerge --ask app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "```"
