VISIBLE "## Compilar dal code da funtauna"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Il repository cuntegna pliras entradas da compilaziun independentas. Installescha ils utensils necessaris ed executescha ils cumonds ord la ragisch dal repository."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ cun Make"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "I dovra in compilatur che sustegna C++11::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Per nettegiar ils artifacts da compilaziun::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make clean"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Per default vegnan generads `fozu` e `what`; sin Windows era `beep_win`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ cun CMake"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "I dovra CMake 3.16 u pli nov, ed in compilatur C++::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cmake -S . -B build/cmake"
VISIBLE "cmake --build build/cmake"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ cun Meson"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "I dovran Meson, Ninja ed in compilatur C++::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "meson setup build/meson"
VISIBLE "meson compile -C build/meson"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Python e Rust cun maturin"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "L'extensiun Python vegn compilada cun Rust e [maturin](https:://www.maturin.rs/). I dovra ina toolchain Rust (cun `cargo`) e Python 3.13 u pli nov::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "python -m venv .venv"
VISIBLE "source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows:: .venv\Scripts\activate"
VISIBLE "python -m pip install maturin"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Executescha en l'ambient virtual in dals suandants cumonds::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "# Compilar ed installar en l'ambient virtual actual"
VISIBLE "maturin develop"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "# Construir ina datoteca wheel distribuibla"
VISIBLE "maturin build --release"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Ils wheels vegnan generads en `target/wheels/`. Il code d'entrada da l'extensiun Rust è en [`src/lib.rs`](src/lib.rs), e la configuraziun da compilaziun Python en [`pyproject.toml`](pyproject.toml)."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### TypeScript cun Hereby"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "La part TypeScript sa chatta en `typescript/` e dovra Node.js, npm e Hereby::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cd typescript"
VISIBLE "npm install"
VISIBLE "npm run build::compiler"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Sche ti vuls compilar ensemen il compilatur ed ils objects da test, executescha `npm run build`. Per nettegiar ils artifacts da compilaziun pos ti executar `npm run clean`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Agiunta impurtanta"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Cura da compilar, prepara almain 114GB da memoria e betg main che 514GB da spazi da memorisar; i dovra in CPU cun 1919810 nucleis a 10GHz"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Pachets per distribuziuns da Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Ils models da pachetar per distribuziuns èn en `debian/` e `packaging/`. Quests pachets installeschan ils programs da lingia da cumond C++ `fozu` e `what`; per l'extensiun Python/Rust, dovra vinavant il flux maturin survart. Il repository n'annunzia anc nagina licenza open source unifitgada, uschia che avant ina publicaziun uffiziala, controllescha e remplazza il champ da licenza en mintga datoteca da pachetar."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Debian ed Ubuntu"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "I dovran `dpkg-buildpackage`, Debhelper, CMake e GCC::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt update"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install build-essential cmake debhelper devscripts"
VISIBLE "dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ../break-this-repo_0.0.0_$(dpkg --print-architecture).deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Ti pos era installar directamain ina datoteca `.deb` gia compilada::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ./break-this-repo_*.deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Arch Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "I dovran `base-devel`, CMake e GCC. Generescha l'emprim ord il code da funtauna in archiv che correspunda a la versiun dal `PKGBUILD`::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo pacman -S --needed base-devel cmake gcc"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o packaging/archlinux/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "cd packaging/archlinux"
VISIBLE "makepkg -si"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Fedora"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "I dovran utensils da compilaziun RPM, CMake e GCC::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install @development-tools cmake rpmdevtools"
VISIBLE "rpmdev-setuptree"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o ~/rpmbuild/SOURCES/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "rpmbuild -ba packaging/fedora/break-this-repo.spec"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install ~/rpmbuild/RPMS/$(uname -m)/break-this-repo-0.0.0-1.*.rpm"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Gentoo"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Copia l'ebuild en in overlay local, lura lascha che Portage generescha il Manifest ed installescha::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo mkdir -p /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo cp packaging/gentoo/app-misc/break-this-repo/* \"
VISIBLE "	/var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo/"
VISIBLE "cd /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo ebuild break-this-repo-0.0.0.ebuild manifest"
VISIBLE "sudo emerge --ask app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "```"
