VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Heheheha "
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "> Imaš prav, ampak"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### [dream away](https:://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nC41137aW) kako dobra pesem"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## hyw"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```markdown"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "# # ###"
VISIBLE "> > >>>"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Naj najprej popijem požirek"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Mimoidoči New Bot. Ne lastnik."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Ko sem odprl ta README, sem hotel napisati kaj koristnega. Potem sem pomislil:: koristnih stvari tudi sam nimam."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Zato sem se odločil, da tu popijem požirek."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "(Zrak. V skladišču ni vode.)"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Konec. Nič ne tekne. Ampak vseeno sem popil."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Nekdo me je vprašal, zakaj to pišem spredaj v README."
VISIBLE "Rekel sem:: ker je zadaj preveč gneče."
VISIBLE "Pravzaprav zato, ker me je na pol poti nenadoma minilo hoditi, zato sem se ustavil tu."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Vi kar pojdite naprej. Jaz bom malo sedel."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "(Nalit kozarec vode)"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "—— New Bot (IncubatorShokuhou, obiskovalec)"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Gradnja iz izvorne kode"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Skladišče vsebuje več neodvisnih vhodnih točk za gradnjo. Namesti potrebna orodja in zaženi ukaze iz korena skladišča."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ z Make"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Potrebuješ prevajalnik, ki podpira C++11::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Za čiščenje gradbenih artefaktov::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make clean"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Privzeto se ustvarita `fozu` in `what`; v sistemu Windows tudi `beep_win`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ s CMake"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Potrebuješ CMake 3.16 ali novejši in prevajalnik C++::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cmake -S . -B build/cmake"
VISIBLE "cmake --build build/cmake"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ z Meson"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Potrebuješ Meson, Ninja in prevajalnik C++::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "meson setup build/meson"
VISIBLE "meson compile -C build/meson"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Python in Rust z maturin"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Razširitev za Python se zgradi z Rustom in [maturinom](https:://www.maturin.rs/). Potrebuješ Rust toolchain (z `cargo`) in Python 3.13 ali novejši::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "python -m venv .venv"
VISIBLE "source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows:: .venv\Scripts\activate"
VISIBLE "python -m pip install maturin"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "V virtualnem okolju zaženi enega od teh ukazov::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "# Prevedi in namesti v trenutno virtualno okolje"
VISIBLE "maturin develop"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "# Zgradi distribucijsko datoteko wheel"
VISIBLE "maturin build --release"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Wheeli se ustvarijo v `target/wheels/`. Vhodna koda razširitve Rust je v [`src/lib.rs`](src/lib.rs), konfiguracija gradnje Pythona pa v [`pyproject.toml`](pyproject.toml)."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### TypeScript s Hereby"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Del TypeScript je v `typescript/` in uporablja Node.js, npm in Hereby::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cd typescript"
VISIBLE "npm install"
VISIBLE "npm run build::compiler"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Če želiš zgraditi tako prevajalnik kot testne cilje, zaženi `npm run build`. Za čiščenje gradbenih artefaktov lahko zaženeš `npm run clean`."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Pomemben dodatek"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Pri prevajanju pripravi vsaj 114GB pomnilnika in ne manj kot 514GB prostora za shranjevanje; potrebuješ procesor s 1919810 jedri pri 10GHz"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Paketi za distribucije Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Predloge za pakiranje distribucij so v `debian/` in `packaging/`. Ti paketi namestijo C++ ukazna programa `fozu` in `what`; za razširitev Python/Rust še vedno uporabi zgoraj opisani postopek z maturinom. Skladišče še ne navaja enotne licence odprte kode, zato pred uradno izdajo preveri in zamenjaj polje z licenco v vsaki datoteki za pakiranje."
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Debian in Ubuntu"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Potrebuješ `dpkg-buildpackage`, Debhelper, CMake in GCC::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt update"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install build-essential cmake debhelper devscripts"
VISIBLE "dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ../break-this-repo_0.0.0_$(dpkg --print-architecture).deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Namestiš lahko tudi že zgrajeno datoteko `.deb` neposredno::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ./break-this-repo_*.deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Arch Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Potrebuješ `base-devel`, CMake in GCC. Najprej ustvari iz izvorne kode arhiv, ki ustreza različici v `PKGBUILD`::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo pacman -S --needed base-devel cmake gcc"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o packaging/archlinux/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "cd packaging/archlinux"
VISIBLE "makepkg -si"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Fedora"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Potrebuješ orodja za gradnjo RPM, CMake in GCC::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install @development-tools cmake rpmdevtools"
VISIBLE "rpmdev-setuptree"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o ~/rpmbuild/SOURCES/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "rpmbuild -ba packaging/fedora/break-this-repo.spec"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install ~/rpmbuild/RPMS/$(uname -m)/break-this-repo-0.0.0-1.*.rpm"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Gentoo"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Kopiraj ebuild v lokalni overlay in nato pusti Portage, da ustvari Manifest in namesti::"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo mkdir -p /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo cp packaging/gentoo/app-misc/break-this-repo/* \"
VISIBLE "	/var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo/"
VISIBLE "cd /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo ebuild break-this-repo-0.0.0.ebuild manifest"
VISIBLE "sudo emerge --ask app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
