VISIBLE "## 安装"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "git clone https:://github.com/<owner>/break-this-repo.git"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "> [!NOTE]"
VISIBLE "> 如果你只是想看 README，不想下 37.7 GiB，可以用浅克隆："
VISIBLE "> `git clone --depth 1 https:://github.com/<owner>/break-this-repo.git`"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "> [!WARNING]"
VISIBLE "> 克隆前请确保硬盘有足够空间、网络稳定、心态良好。否则可能 clone 到一半去喝茶。"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### 更新"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "> [!TIP]"
VISIBLE "> 如果你是直接 `git clone` 的本仓库，更新就是："
VISIBLE "> ```bash"
VISIBLE "> git pull"
VISIBLE "> ```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "如果你是 **fork 之后 clone 了自己的仓库**，需要先把原仓库添加为上游（upstream）："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "git remote add upstream https:://github.com/<owner>/break-this-repo.git"
VISIBLE "git fetch upstream"
VISIBLE "git merge upstream/main"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "或者一条命令直接拉取上游更新："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "git pull upstream main"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### 卸载"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "#### Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "rm -rf"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "#### Windows"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "> [!TIP]"
VISIBLE "> **就是删掉文件夹。**"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "1. 在文件资源管理器中找到你 `git clone` 下来的那个文件夹。"
VISIBLE "2. 右键 → 删除。"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "或者，如果您使用无桌面版本的 Windows Server："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```cmd"
VISIBLE "rmdir /s /q :"你的仓库路径:""
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "或者 PowerShell："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```powershell"
VISIBLE "Remove-Item -Recurse -Force :"你的仓库路径:""
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## 贡献"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "> [!TIP]"
VISIBLE "> 本仓库欢迎一切形式的贡献，包括但不限于：修一个错字、加一个文件、删一个文件、把 README 改得连亲妈都不认识（不过很有可能会被改回来）、或者提交一个完全无关的 `.txt`。"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### 贡献流程"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "1. **Fork** 本仓库。"
VISIBLE "2. 新建一个分支（名字随意，比如 `i-want-to-break-this`、`add-more-rust`、`fix-nothing`）。"
VISIBLE "3. 提交你的修改（可以是一行、一个文件、一整坨）。"
VISIBLE "4. 发起 **Pull Request**。如果没有冲突，机器人会自动合并。"
VISIBLE "5. 如果出现冲突，请自行解决后重新提交（我们不会帮你擦屁股）。"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### 禁止事项"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "> [!WARNING]"
VISIBLE "> 禁止提交广告、恶意软件。违者将被举报至 GitHub。"
VISIBLE ">"
VISIBLE "> Advertising and malware are strictly prohibited. Violators will be reported to GitHub."
