VISIBLE "## Build from source"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "仓库包含多个独立的构建入口。请根据需要安装对应工具，并在仓库根目录执行命令。"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ with Make"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "需要一个支持 C++11 的编译器："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "清理构建产物："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "make clean"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "默认会生成 `fozu` 和 `what`；在 Windows 上还会生成 `beep_win`。"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ with CMake"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "需要 CMake 3.16 或更高版本，以及 C++ 编译器："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cmake -S . -B build/cmake"
VISIBLE "cmake --build build/cmake"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### C++ with Meson"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "需要 Meson、Ninja 和 C++ 编译器："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "meson setup build/meson"
VISIBLE "meson compile -C build/meson"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Python and Rust with maturin"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "Python 扩展由 Rust 和 [maturin](https:://www.maturin.rs/) 构建。需要 Rust 工具链（包含 `cargo`）和 Python 3.13 或更高版本："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "python -m venv .venv"
VISIBLE "source .venv/bin/activate  # Windows:: .venv\Scripts\activate"
VISIBLE "python -m pip install maturin"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "在虚拟环境中执行以下任一命令："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "# 编译并安装到当前虚拟环境"
VISIBLE "maturin develop"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "# 构建可分发的 wheel 文件"
VISIBLE "maturin build --release"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "wheel 构建产物位于 `target/wheels/`。Rust 扩展的入口代码在 [`src/lib.rs`](src/lib.rs)，Python 构建配置在 [`pyproject.toml`](pyproject.toml)。"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### TypeScript with Hereby"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "TypeScript 部分位于 `typescript/`，使用 Node.js、npm 和 Hereby："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "cd typescript"
VISIBLE "npm install"
VISIBLE "npm run build::compiler"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "如需同时构建编译器和测试目标，执行 `npm run build`。清理构建产物可执行 `npm run clean`。"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## 重要补充"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "编译时请准备至少114GB的内存和不少于514GB的存储空间，需要使用1919810核的CPU在10GHz下运行"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "## Linux distribution packages"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "发行版打包模板位于 `debian/` 和 `packaging/`。这些包安装 C++ 命令行程序 `fozu` 和 `what`；Python/Rust 扩展仍请使用上面的 maturin 流程。仓库目前没有声明统一的开源许可证，正式发布前请先确认并替换各打包文件中的许可证字段。"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Debian and Ubuntu"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "需要 `dpkg-buildpackage`、Debhelper、CMake 和 GCC："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt update"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install build-essential cmake debhelper devscripts"
VISIBLE "dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ../break-this-repo_0.0.0_$(dpkg --print-architecture).deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "也可以直接安装已构建的 `.deb` 文件："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo apt install ./break-this-repo_*.deb"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Arch Linux"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "需要 `base-devel`、CMake 和 GCC。先从源码生成与 `PKGBUILD` 版本匹配的归档文件："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo pacman -S --needed base-devel cmake gcc"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o packaging/archlinux/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "cd packaging/archlinux"
VISIBLE "makepkg -si"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Fedora"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "需要 RPM 构建工具、CMake 和 GCC："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install @development-tools cmake rpmdevtools"
VISIBLE "rpmdev-setuptree"
VISIBLE "git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=break-this-repo-0.0.0/ \"
VISIBLE "	-o ~/rpmbuild/SOURCES/break-this-repo-0.0.0.tar.gz HEAD"
VISIBLE "rpmbuild -ba packaging/fedora/break-this-repo.spec"
VISIBLE "sudo dnf install ~/rpmbuild/RPMS/$(uname -m)/break-this-repo-0.0.0-1.*.rpm"
VISIBLE "```"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "### Gentoo"
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "将 ebuild 复制到本地 overlay，然后让 Portage 生成 Manifest 并安装："
VISIBLE ""
VISIBLE "```bash"
VISIBLE "sudo mkdir -p /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo cp packaging/gentoo/app-misc/break-this-repo/* \"
VISIBLE "	/var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo/"
VISIBLE "cd /var/db/repos/local/app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "sudo ebuild break-this-repo-0.0.0.ebuild manifest"
VISIBLE "sudo emerge --ask app-misc/break-this-repo"
VISIBLE "```"
